{
  "2026-04-15": {
    "reel": {
      "name": "reel-1-think-about-it",
      "file": "05_assets/clips/premium/reels/reel-01-think-about-it.mp4",
      "caption": "Your leads don't need to \"think about it.\" They need a reason to trust you before the call.\n\nMost coaches try to fix this with better scripts. Better objection handling. Better closing lines.\n\nThat's not the problem. The problem is there's no value built before the conversation.\n\nFix the trust. The sales fix themselves.\n\n(Disclaimer: This is based on what I've observed; results are not guaranteed!)\n\nFollow for more.\n\n#onlinefitnesscoach #onlinefitnesscoaches"
    },
    "carousel": {
      "name": "carousel-1-discipline-battery",
      "folder": "carousel-1-discipline-battery",
      "caption": "You keep crashing every few weeks and calling it burnout.\n\nIt's not burnout. It's a dead battery with no recharge plan.\n\nAfter studying nearly 200 online fitness coaches, I noticed the ones who last aren't the ones who go hardest. They're the ones who planned when to stop.\n\nPlan your rest like you plan your training.\n\n(Disclaimer: This is based on what I've observed; results are not guaranteed!)\n\n-Dani Gomez\n\n#onlinefitnesscoach #onlinefitnesscoaches"
    }
  },
  "2026-04-16": {
    "reel": {
      "name": "reel-2-80-percent-quit",
      "file": "05_assets/clips/premium/reels/reel-02-final.mp4",
      "caption": "80% of online fitness coaches quit in year one. Not because they're bad coaches. Because they have no system.\n\nNo predictable way to get clients. No structure. Just posting, hoping, waiting.\n\nYou're still here looking for answers. That's the difference.\n\n(Disclaimer: This is based on what I've observed; results are not guaranteed!)\n\nFollow for more.\n\n#onlinefitnesscoach #onlinefitnesscoaches"
    },
    "carousel": {
      "name": "carousel-2-coach-vs-business-owner",
      "folder": "carousel-2-coach-vs-business-owner",
      "caption": "You became a coach because you're great at coaching.\n\nBut running a business is a different skill.\n\nAfter studying nearly 200 online fitness coaches, these 6 signs showed up over and over in the coaches who were stuck.\n\nThe shift isn't about coaching less. It's about building systems around your coding.\n\n(Disclaimer: This is based on what I've observed; results are not guaranteed!)\n\n-Dani Gomez\n\n#onlinefitnesscoach #onlinefitnesscoaches"
    }
  },
  "2026-04-17": {
    "reel": {
      "name": "reel-3-lead-problem",
      "file": "05_assets/clips/premium/reels/reel-03-final.mp4",
      "cdn_url": "https://files.catbox.moe/tg5evv.mp4",
      "caption": "47 inquiries. Zero clients. Same month, same niche, another coach had 11 inquiries and signed 4.\n\nThe difference wasn't the leads. It was the system. One had predictable steps. The other had a messy inbox and hope.\n\nMore leads will not fix a broken system.\n\n(Disclaimer: This is based on what I've observed; results are not guaranteed!)\n\nFollow for more.\n\n#onlinefitnesscoach #onlinefitnesscoaches"
    },
    "carousel": {
      "name": "carousel-3-free-coaching",
      "folder": "carousel-3-free-coaching",
      "caption": "\"Just coach for free until you get testimonials.\"\n\nI keep hearing this advice everywhere. And I keep seeing it fail.\n\nOne coach did everything right -- cold outreach, VAs, a marketing agency, free coaching -- for two years. Zero paying clients.\n\nFree coaching doesn't fix a differentiation problem. It hides it.\n\n(Disclaimer: This is based on what I've observed; results are not guaranteed!)\n\n-Dani Gomez\n\n#onlinefitnesscoach #onlinefitnesscoaches"
    }
  },
  "2026-04-18": {
    "reel": {
      "name": "reel-4-starting-from-zero",
      "file": "05_assets/clips/premium/reels/reel-04-final.mp4",
      "cdn_url": "https://files.catbox.moe/q93lji.mp4",
      "caption": "84% of clients in this industry come from referrals. No system. Just luck.\n\nThat's why every month feels like starting from zero. One slow week and everything stops.\n\nYou need 3 systems: lead flow, nurture, and sales. Predictable steps that result in a predictable outcome.\n\n(Disclaimer: This is based on what I've observed; results are not guaranteed!)\n\nFollow for more.\n\n#onlinefitnesscoach #onlinefitnesscoaches"
    },
    "carousel": {
      "name": "carousel-4-saturated",
      "folder": "carousel-4-saturated",
      "caption": "\"The space is saturated.\"\n\nI hear this every single day from online fitness coaches. And they're right -- the bottom IS crowded.\n\nBut a $34 billion market growing at 28% per year is not saturated at the top. The coaches who have a clear niche, a real voice, and a system are almost impossible to find.\n\nStop competing with everyone. Start being for someone.\n\n(Disclaimer: This is based on what I've observed; results are not guaranteed!)\n\n-Dani Gomez\n\n#onlinefitnesscoach #onlinefitnesscoaches"
    }
  },
  "2026-04-19": {
    "reel": {
      "name": "reel-5-feel-like-a-fraud",
      "file": "05_assets/clips/premium/reels/reel-05-final.mp4",
      "cdn_url": "https://files.catbox.moe/i3orep.mp4",
      "caption": "You feel like a fraud because coaches with half your knowledge are doing better.\n\nThey're not better coaches. They're more visible. They show up. They post. They put themselves out there.\n\nInvisible credibility pays zero. The more people know you exist, the less you'll feel like an impostor.\n\n(Disclaimer: This is based on what I've observed; results are not guaranteed!)\n\nFollow for more.\n\n#onlinefitnesscoach #onlinefitnesscoaches"
    },
    "carousel": {
      "name": "carousel-5-47k-trap",
      "folder": "carousel-5-47k-trap",
      "caption": "$47,000 a year. Only 28% full-time.\n\nThose are the real numbers behind the fitness coaching industry.\n\nNot because coaches aren't talented. Because they were never taught the business side.\n\nProgram design is a skill. Getting clients is also a skill. The coaches who treat it that way don't stay at $47K.\n\n(Disclaimer: This is based on what I've observed; results are not guaranteed!)\n\n-Dani Gomez\n\n#onlinefitnesscoach #onlinefitnesscoaches"
    }
  },
  "2026-04-20": {
    "reel": {
      "name": "reel-6-not-burned-out",
      "file": "05_assets/clips/premium/reels/reel-06-final.mp4",
      "cdn_url": "https://files.catbox.moe/34a8w4.mp4",
      "caption": "You're not burned out. You're doing the work of 5 people with zero systems.\n\nTrainer. Marketer. Tech support. Admin. Salesperson. Every day. All of them. None done well.\n\nRest won't fix that. A system will. Predictable steps that result in a predictable outcome.\n\nBuild the system. The burnout disappears.\n\n(Disclaimer: This is based on what I've observed; results are not guaranteed!)\n\nFollow for more.\n\n#onlinefitnesscoach #onlinefitnesscoaches"
    },
    "carousel": {
      "name": "carousel-6-client-systems",
      "folder": "carousel-6-client-systems",
      "caption": "Your clients shouldn't have to chase you for basic information.\n\n\"When do I check in?\" \"How do I contact you?\" \"Can I see my progress?\"\n\nEvery one of those questions is a system you haven't built.\n\nAfter studying nearly 200 online fitness coaches, the ones who retained clients the longest weren't the best programmers. They had the best systems.\n\n(Disclaimer: This is based on what I've observed; results are not guaranteed!)\n\n-Dani Gomez\n\n#onlinefitnesscoach #onlinefitnesscoaches"
    }
  },
  "2026-04-21": {
    "reel": {
      "name": "reel-7-nobody-will-see-this",
      "file": "05_assets/clips/premium/reels/reel-07-final.mp4",
      "cdn_url": "https://files.catbox.moe/2r573r.mp4",
      "caption": "You posted. 20 views. And now you want to quit.\n\nThere are 8 billion people on Earth. 1% of that is 80 million. You're not saturated. You're invisible. And invisible is fixable.\n\nKeep posting. You get better. More people find you. It compounds.\n\nIt takes reps.\n\n(Disclaimer: This is based on what I've observed; results are not guaranteed!)\n\nFollow for more.\n\n#onlinefitnesscoach #onlinefitnesscoaches"
    },
    "carousel": {
      "name": "carousel-7-half-my-knowledge",
      "folder": "carousel-7-half-my-knowledge",
      "caption": "\"People with half my knowledge are doing better than me.\"\n\nI hear this from online fitness coaches constantly. And they're always right.\n\nThe difference is never knowledge. It's visibility.\n\nThe coach with half your skills but twice your visibility will make more money every single time. That's not unfair. That's a skill gap you can fix.\n\n(Disclaimer: This is based on what I've observed; results are not guaranteed!)\n\n-Dani Gomez\n\n#onlinefitnesscoach #onlinefitnesscoaches"
    }
  },
